  "shortDescription": "The Nile transforms PostgreSQL into a powerful solution tailored for multi-tenant B2B applications. It allows developers to manage a single Postgres database while providing the illusion of unlimited virtual tenant databases. This is ideal for SaaS providers needing scalable, secure data isolation and efficient management of customer-specific data. Example use case includes SaaS platforms that require rapid scaling and data isolation for each client.",
